00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.040
KUBOZUKA YÔSUKE
NAKAMURA AIMI

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.040
KURODA MIKI
OGURI SHUN

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.040
FUJIKI NAOHITO

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.040
